sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Client
    participant P as Bedrock Proxy
    participant B as Bedrock Mantle
    participant R as Redis (Optional)
    participant T as Telegram (Optional)
    
    Note over C,T: Non-Streaming Request
    
    C->>+P: POST /v1/chat/completions
    P->>P: Validate request
    P->>P: Authentication check
    
    alt Cache hit (Redis enabled)
        P->>R: Check cache
        R-->>P: Cached response
        P-->>C: Return cached response
    else Cache miss or Redis disabled
        P->>P: Translate model ID
        P->>+B: POST /anthropic/v1/messages
        B-->>-P: Model response
        P->>P: Transform to OpenAI format
        
        opt Redis enabled
            P->>R: Cache response
        end
        
        opt Telegram enabled
            P->>T: Send notification
        end
        
        P-->>-C: Return response
    end
    
    Note over C,T: Streaming Request
    
    C->>+P: POST /v1/chat/completions (stream: true)
    P->>P: Validate request
    P->>+B: POST with streaming
    loop SSE chunks
        B-->>P: Data chunk
        P->>P: Transform chunk
        opt Redis enabled
            P->>R: Cache chunk
        end
        P-->>C: SSE chunk
    end
    B-->>-P: Stream complete
    P-->>-C: Stream end
    
    opt Telegram enabled
        P->>T: Send completion notification
    end
